          "source": "english-georgian-country-house proportional_system typical_ratios and constraint c02"
        }
      },
      "rule": "Sash proportion 1.7:1 to 2:1, in 12-over-12 lights before about 1770 and 6-over-6 after (the same dating ladder as the trunk style, run the full length of this type's 1720-1830 span) -- a single vertical sash proportion, replacing the wide horizontal medieval mullion-and-transom window this slot would otherwise inherit through the corpus's deep Tudor-Jacobean ancestry.",
